<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Joe Cai 的博客</title><description>大模型记忆系统、工程笔记与长文翻译。</description><link>https://joevilcai666.github.io/</link><language>zh-CN</language><item><title>好的写作，是好的思考</title><link>https://joevilcai666.github.io/blog/good-writing-good-product/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://joevilcai666.github.io/blog/good-writing-good-product/</guid><description>写作让我发现自己还没想清楚的地方。把问题、选择和理由写明白，团队才能一起判断，而这些判断最终会成为产品。</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>环境的重要性</title><link>https://joevilcai666.github.io/blog/environment/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://joevilcai666.github.io/blog/environment/</guid><description>创业的结果有很多不确定性。我想主动创造一种环境，让人理解目标、得到反馈，也愿意继续投入。</description><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>愿景</title><link>https://joevilcai666.github.io/blog/vision/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://joevilcai666.github.io/blog/vision/</guid><description>做产品的人，得先学会做梦。愿景从自己想改变的现状出发，也要经得起别人是否愿意付钱的检验。</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>